            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is different. I made it exactly as the recipe stated. I just don't know if I like the combination of milk and whiskey, when it isn't eggnog. I mean, it's like it's trying to be eggnog only with irish creme. I think I'll wait another couple days and make another one and see if I like it.",
            "datePublished": "2008-12-15T12:01:11.883Z"
          }
